WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Opportunity for everyone.
The EEO Innovative Best Practices Grant Initiative.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A more inclusive future.
Advancing faculty and staff diversity through innovative institutional practices.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Open more pathways.
Explore new approaches to equitable recruitment and inclusive hiring.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Help people thrive.
Create space for mentorship, learning, and professional growth.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Build stronger connections.
Support workplace cultures where faculty and staff can belong and contribute.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Distinct ideas. Shared purpose.
Allan Hancock Joint CCD: Strengthening equitable hiring and faculty mentorship. Antelope Valley CCD: Connecting employees through the LIFT Mentor Match program. Citrus CCD: Expanding access to mentorship and professional development.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Distinct ideas. Shared purpose.
Kern CCD: Combining virtual reality faculty development with peer mentoring. Mt. San Antonio CCD: Advancing belonging through mentorship and restorative practices. North Orange County CCD: Strengthening inclusive hiring through training, student voice, and data.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Distinct ideas. Shared purpose.
Peralta CCD: Connecting classified professionals with mentorship and leadership opportunities. San Diego CCD: Advancing transparent and equitable recruitment through TRACE. Santa Monica CCD: Fostering belonging through professional development, mentorship, and employee resource groups.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Distinct ideas. Shared purpose.
State Center CCD: Preparing prospective faculty through mentored Faculty in Training internships. West Valley-Mission CCD: Expanding equitable professional development through LIFT mentorship.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Make room for new ideas.
Pilot promising practices. Strengthen existing efforts. Keep opportunity at the center.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Move forward, together.
Connect ideas and people around a shared commitment to equal employment opportunity.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Better practices. Broader opportunity.
EEO Innovative Best Practices Grant Initiative.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Be part of what comes next.
California Community Colleges Chancellor’s Office eeodashboard.io
